Recommends: adwaita-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu-core, librsvg2-common
Description: Notepad++ source code editor - native GTK 3 port (preview)
 Unofficial native Linux build of the Notepad++ source tree using the GTK 3
 backend of Scintilla. This preview provides tabbed editing, syntax
 highlighting for all Notepad++ languages via Lexilla, Notepad++ colour
 themes, encoding detection, and Boost-regex find/replace.
 .
 Plugins, docking panels, macros and sessions are not yet ported.
